Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: snapshot-themes
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, papirus-icon-theme, fonts-firacode, fonts-cantarell
Description: SnapshOT desktop theme, wallpaper, and Xfce defaults
 The SnapshOT dark desktop for the OT assessment distribution: the SnapshOT-Dark
 GTK/xfwm4 theme, Papirus-Dark icon defaults, the wallpaper and the LightDM
 greeter branding, and system-wide Xfce defaults under /etc/xdg (panel, whisker
 menu, terminal, xfwm4, xfconf and Qt) applied like Kali's kali-themes. The
 SnapshOT app and panel-menu icons are shipped in the hicolor theme.
